WEBVTT

00:09:30.608 --> 00:09:33.777
what happens when we outsource violence,

00:09:33.819 --> 00:09:36.530
the extinguishing of a human life,

00:09:36.530 --> 00:09:37.781
to a computer?

00:09:39.199 --> 00:09:43.412
What happens to us
as an interconnected global community

00:09:43.412 --> 00:09:45.706
when a machine and not a human

00:09:45.706 --> 00:09:49.793
decides whether a life is worth something?

00:09:51.170 --> 00:09:53.130
This is all bleak,

00:09:53.172 --> 00:09:54.548
but not hopeless.

00:09:55.591 --> 00:09:59.928
There's always room to adjust
our trajectory to a better future.